			"notes": "+ First mod version\n+ Can customize whether arrows can be reflected (vanilla-ish behavior), blocked (arrow doesn't get reflected, but damage ignored), or ignored (still take damage), as well as reflect force and shield damage taken and whether the reflected arrow is a guaranteed crit. Can also just revert to completely vanilla arrow behavior.\n+ Can customize whether splash potions can be reflected, blocked, or ignored, as well as reflect force and shield damage taken.\n+ Can customize amount of damage taken by blocked melee attacks, and whether any of the damage is applied as thorns to the attacker. Also can configure shield damage, and whether it is constant or scaled based on the attack strength.\n+ Can customize shield sound effects."
